msgstr "Superset Mobile menjalankan agen di komputer yang Anda hubungkan."

msgid "Superset needs Full Disk Access to read another browser's data. Grant it in System Settings, then check again."
msgstr "Superset butuh Full Disk Access untuk membaca data browser lain. Berikan izinnya di System Settings, lalu periksa lagi."

msgid "Superset originals"
msgstr "Orisinal Superset"

msgid "Superset runs locally on your developers' machines. We don't store your code or AI conversations, and Superset has completed a SOC 2 Type II audit with an independent auditor. Request the report and review our security documentation at trust.superset.sh."
msgstr "Superset berjalan lokal di mesin developer Anda. Kami tidak menyimpan kode atau percakapan AI Anda, dan Superset telah menyelesaikan audit SOC 2 Type II dengan auditor independen. Minta laporannya dan tinjau dokumentasi keamanan kami di trust.superset.sh."

msgid "Superset started as a hackathon project in November 2025. It was a simple desktop app for managing worktrees."
msgstr "Superset bermula sebagai proyek hackathon pada November 2025. Waktu itu sekadar aplikasi desktop untuk mengelola worktree."

