msgid "The agent owns a task from ticket to diff. The human reviews the result, not the keystrokes. Attention shifts from writing code to specifying work and judging it. One engineer runs several agents at once in isolated workspaces."
msgstr "Agen memegang tugas dari tiket sampai diff. Manusia mereview hasilnya, bukan tiap ketukan tombolnya. Perhatian bergeser dari menulis kode ke menentukan pekerjaan dan menilainya. Satu engineer menjalankan beberapa agen sekaligus di workspace terisolasi."

msgid "The agent this automation was set to run no longer exists on its host — the host's agents may have been reset or removed. Re-select an agent in the automation's settings."
msgstr "Agen yang disetel untuk menjalankan otomatisasi ini sudah tidak ada di host-nya — agen host itu mungkin telah direset atau dihapus. Pilih ulang agen di pengaturan otomatisasi."

